<title>USA: Naples, Fla., $40 mln hospital bonds repriced.</title>
<headline>Naples, Fla., $40 mln hospital bonds repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said it repriced a $40 million Naples, Fla., hospital revenue bond issue for Naples Community Hospital Inc project series 1996, cutting yields throughout the issue.</p>
<p>CITY OF NAPLES, FLORIDA</p>
<p>RE: $40,000,000*</p>
<p>HOSPITAL REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>(NAPLES COMMUNITY HOSPITAL, INC. PROJ.) SER. 1996</p>
